WEBVTT

00:00:22.210 --> 00:00:24.130
I... I see you are well.

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:28.550
Wh-What's this?

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:30.800
My--My apologies.

00:00:31.260 --> 00:00:37.720
As a King's consort in troubled times,
I must not cry.

00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:38.730
But...

00:00:40.730 --> 00:00:43.690
My deepest apologies, Your Highness.

00:00:45.820 --> 00:00:48.190
My tears--they won't stop falling.

00:00:50.110 --> 00:00:51.110
Kou.

00:00:57.370 --> 00:00:59.290
I've returned, just as I'd promised.

00:02:37.470 --> 00:02:40.640
The Difference Between Dances

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:46.440
V-V-Very well, then:

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:51.070
Let the awards ceremony begin!

00:03:09.210 --> 00:03:11.920
All of your hard work

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:14.670
saved us from the crisis
of statelessness--

00:03:14.670 --> 00:03:16.970
a great cause indeed.

00:03:16.970 --> 00:03:19.970
Among you are our various generals:

00:03:19.970 --> 00:03:28.560
Mou Gou, Chou Tou, Kan Ki, Ou Sen,
Mou Bu, Tou, and Lord Hyou.

00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:30.560
It is most regrettable

00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:33.820
for me as King--and for Chin itself--

00:03:33.820 --> 00:03:38.700
to have lost two of you in battle:
Chou Tou and Lord Hyou.

00:03:40.280 --> 00:03:46.080
It is difficult to rank the feats
of these seven generals.

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:48.920
Therefore, one general aside,

00:03:48.920 --> 00:03:53.300
six will receive the same special
commendation for defending our kingdom.

00:03:53.300 --> 00:03:56.420
We purposely singled out one general

00:03:56.420 --> 00:04:01.600
because of these seven, he distinguished
himself in even greater ways.

00:04:01.600 --> 00:04:05.640
To this individual will go
this campaign's highest honor.

00:04:05.640 --> 00:04:07.680
The highest honor!

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:10.730
Now for that highest honor.

00:04:10.730 --> 00:04:12.810
General Mou Bu, step forward!

00:04:16.740 --> 00:04:17.740
Father!

00:04:19.070 --> 00:04:22.780
General Mou Bu slayed So
commanding general Kan Mei,

00:04:22.780 --> 00:04:26.330
the coalition army's most formidable foe.

00:04:26.330 --> 00:04:30.460
Still wounded, he chased
after the coalition army

00:04:30.460 --> 00:04:32.880
and cut them down considerably.

00:04:32.880 --> 00:04:35.500
As the army's high commander, I thank you.

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:41.970
General Mou Bu will go up
two ranks in the peerage,

00:04:41.970 --> 00:04:45.060
and receive the lands of
Ryuujin and Shunjin,

00:04:45.060 --> 00:04:48.140
3,000 gold pieces,
and ten treasures.

00:04:55.860 --> 00:04:57.980
The six specially distinguished generals

00:04:57.980 --> 00:05:00.570
will go up two ranks in the peerage,

00:05:00.570 --> 00:05:05.740
and each receive land, 3,000
gold pieces, and ten treasures.

00:05:05.740 --> 00:05:07.200
Three thousand gold pieces!

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:08.790
Not bad at all.

00:05:10.710 --> 00:05:12.920
On this occasion,

00:05:12.920 --> 00:05:15.460
we also have three
special-recognition awards

00:05:15.460 --> 00:05:17.460
for distinguished feats in battle.

00:05:19.590 --> 00:05:21.880
The first goes to the people of Sai!

00:05:24.510 --> 00:05:27.430
Though mostly civilians,

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:31.600
they risked their lives to fight for Chin

00:05:31.600 --> 00:05:33.560
and repelled Ri Boku's army!

00:05:35.110 --> 00:05:37.570
You betcha.

00:05:37.570 --> 00:05:42.240
Every resident of Sai will go up
two ranks in the peerage,

00:05:42.240 --> 00:05:45.870
and receive a handsome amount of gold.

00:05:45.870 --> 00:05:46.950
I thank you.

00:05:48.620 --> 00:05:50.950
Your Highness...

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:52.870
The second award

00:05:52.870 --> 00:05:57.250
goes to the mountain king,
Yo Tan Wa, and her tribe!

00:05:57.250 --> 00:06:00.130
M-Mountain folk...

00:06:00.130 --> 00:06:04.930
As the mountain king Yo Tan Wa
is battling in the mountains,

00:06:04.930 --> 00:06:07.510
we have here her representative.

00:06:07.510 --> 00:06:09.680
Chin gives Yo Tan Wa the rank

00:06:09.680 --> 00:06:11.520
"Senior Leader of the
Sovereign's Accomplished"

00:06:11.520 --> 00:06:13.730
and 30 treasures;

00:06:13.730 --> 00:06:19.230
we plan to reestablish diplomatic
relations with her tribe.

00:06:19.230 --> 00:06:20.980
"Senior Leader"--?

00:06:20.980 --> 00:06:22.190
Diplomatic relations?

00:06:29.080 --> 00:06:31.660
And our third award:

00:06:31.660 --> 00:06:34.330
the last of our special-recognition
awards today.

00:06:37.250 --> 00:06:40.420
In our first battle with
the coalition army,

00:06:40.420 --> 00:06:43.130
this person slayed Sho's
general Man Goku himself.

00:06:45.220 --> 00:06:46.510
Man Goku?!

00:06:46.510 --> 00:06:50.180
With Lord Hyou, he pursued Ri Boku's
army on the southern road,

00:06:50.180 --> 00:06:52.680
and fought them to buy time.

00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:56.270
As a leader in the fierce
fighting on Sai's south wall,

00:06:56.270 --> 00:07:00.070
he took the reins and defended it well.

00:07:00.070 --> 00:07:05.070
Finally, he faced Hou Ken
of the Three Greats,

00:07:05.070 --> 00:07:10.530
and demonstrated Chin's
military prowess in a duel!

00:07:10.530 --> 00:07:13.790
What?! A duel--with <i>that </i>Hou Ken?

00:07:13.790 --> 00:07:16.580
And taking that evil
Man Goku's head--that's big!

00:07:19.130 --> 00:07:22.500
Captain Shin of the Hi Shin Force!
Step forward!

00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:23.510
Here!

00:07:30.180 --> 00:07:33.100
Wasn't he up there last time, too?

00:07:36.770 --> 00:07:37.940
Seriously?

00:07:46.780 --> 00:07:50.620
Shin of the Hi Shin Force will
go up one rank in the peerage,

00:07:50.620 --> 00:07:53.240
and receive more land for
his residence in Fuuri,

00:07:53.240 --> 00:07:56.410
500 gold coins,
and five treasures.

00:07:56.410 --> 00:08:00.000
He will also be promoted
from battalion commander...

00:08:01.250 --> 00:08:03.000
...to brigade commander!

00:08:05.840 --> 00:08:08.970
That raggedy-looking youth...

00:08:08.970 --> 00:08:10.840
...commanding 3,000 troops?

00:08:17.560 --> 00:08:18.980
He got us beat.

00:08:18.980 --> 00:08:20.650
Tch.

00:08:20.650 --> 00:08:22.060
He caught up with me...

00:08:23.650 --> 00:08:25.230
What's wrong?

00:08:25.230 --> 00:08:28.320
You were whooping it up earlier.
Aren't you happy?

00:08:28.320 --> 00:08:31.950
Oh, I'm happy, all right.
I could jump for joy.

00:08:31.950 --> 00:08:33.910
It's just...

00:08:33.910 --> 00:08:38.460
I saw what was comin', and now
I'm more excited than anything.

00:08:38.460 --> 00:08:42.420
Four thousand, 5,000...
three ranks left--

00:08:42.420 --> 00:08:43.540
to general!

00:08:44.840 --> 00:08:45.840
Yes.

00:08:48.420 --> 00:08:51.380
You better hurry, Sei.

00:08:51.380 --> 00:08:52.550
I know.

00:08:54.800 --> 00:08:56.310
Count off!

00:08:56.310 --> 00:08:57.010
One!

00:08:57.010 --> 00:08:57.680
Two!

00:08:57.680 --> 00:08:58.470
Three!

00:08:58.470 --> 00:08:59.350
Four!

00:08:59.350 --> 00:09:00.850
352!

00:09:00.850 --> 00:09:02.190
353!

00:09:02.190 --> 00:09:03.940
354!

00:09:03.940 --> 00:09:06.070
Don't make us do this one by one!

00:09:06.070 --> 00:09:07.780
899!

00:09:07.780 --> 00:09:09.400
921!

00:09:09.400 --> 00:09:10.650
922!

00:09:09.400 --> 00:09:12.240
Not sure I'm happy about this...

00:09:10.650 --> 00:09:12.240
923!

00:09:12.240 --> 00:09:14.160
2,998!

00:09:14.160 --> 00:09:15.990
2,999!

00:09:15.990 --> 00:09:17.950
Three... 3,000!

00:09:17.950 --> 00:09:19.080
All right!

00:09:20.160 --> 00:09:22.960
3,000-man Hi Shin Force, move out!

00:09:24.250 --> 00:09:26.460
That's <i>it</i>?! Just roll call?

00:09:26.540 --> 00:09:35.340
"Hi"

00:09:28.050 --> 00:09:30.670
Not even half a month after
the awards ceremony,

00:09:30.670 --> 00:09:36.100
the reborn Hi Shin Force was dispatched
to Kaisou, on the front lines,

00:09:36.100 --> 00:09:41.060
to rebuild and patrol the village,
ravaged in the coalition army battle.

00:09:43.940 --> 00:09:46.820
Lord Hyou's soldiers
are impressive, all right.

00:09:47.520 --> 00:09:50.110
Sure am glad you're on my squad, Gaku Rai!

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:53.440
Battalion Commander

00:10:04.120 --> 00:10:08.210
What of my lord's...
of General Hyou's shield?

00:10:08.210 --> 00:10:11.920
I couldn't risk leavin' it
in an empty house.

00:10:11.920 --> 00:10:14.380
I got a trustworthy
friend lookin' after it.

00:10:15.550 --> 00:10:18.970
That and Ou Ki's poleaxe.

00:10:18.970 --> 00:10:20.640
I see.

00:10:20.640 --> 00:10:25.060
Most of Lord Hyou's troops have
returned to the general's domain.

00:10:25.060 --> 00:10:27.150
Why join the Hi Shin Force, Gaku Rai?

00:10:28.480 --> 00:10:29.360
I don't know.

00:10:29.360 --> 00:10:30.690
Huh?!

00:10:30.690 --> 00:10:33.530
Most of Lord Hyou's men dislike Shin.

00:10:35.450 --> 00:10:37.320
Jealousy, that's all.

00:10:37.320 --> 00:10:41.950
The general seemed strangely
happy when talking to you.

00:10:41.950 --> 00:10:45.670
Perhaps it's because he
had no children of his own.

00:10:45.670 --> 00:10:48.790
We hadn't seen that face
on the general in a long time.

00:10:50.340 --> 00:10:56.470
So there's no real reason
behind my joining your unit.

00:10:56.470 --> 00:10:57.470
Huh.

00:11:03.060 --> 00:11:06.020
Hey! Havin' fun over there?

00:11:06.020 --> 00:11:09.360
The sheer youth here must
have taken you by surprise.

00:11:10.900 --> 00:11:14.150
Bi Hei! We're rebuildin'
at top speed tomorrow!

00:11:14.150 --> 00:11:16.240
At top speed?

00:11:14.150 --> 00:11:16.240
No, that's not it.

00:11:17.660 --> 00:11:20.950
They're mostly all like this...

00:11:20.950 --> 00:11:22.990
Startin' tomorrow, I'm countin' on you all!

00:11:22.070 --> 00:11:25.830
...the men and their units on their way up.

00:11:25.830 --> 00:11:29.710
Yes, true enough. You're right.

00:11:29.710 --> 00:11:33.210
Though I <i>was </i>surprised
that their tactician is a girl.

00:11:33.210 --> 00:11:35.670
We didn't have any of <i>those</i>.

00:11:35.670 --> 00:11:37.380
Ga Ro.

00:11:37.380 --> 00:11:40.760
Knows her way around a sword, too.

00:11:40.760 --> 00:11:44.060
You're all mixed up there, Walleye.

00:11:44.060 --> 00:11:45.390
That's <i>Ga Ro</i>!

00:11:45.390 --> 00:11:49.900
The Hi Shin Force does have an
amazingly talented woman lieutenant.

00:11:49.900 --> 00:11:51.520
But she ain't Ten.

00:11:52.980 --> 00:11:55.190
Where is she?

00:11:55.190 --> 00:11:59.360
Good question. Off travelin' somewhere.

00:11:59.360 --> 00:12:00.370
Traveling?!

00:12:01.950 --> 00:12:04.290
Don't you worry!

00:12:04.290 --> 00:12:06.620
She'll be back soon enough.

00:12:09.200 --> 00:12:12.790
Mount Rou, Sho

00:12:20.050 --> 00:12:23.810
You must be Kyou Kai.

00:12:23.810 --> 00:12:26.980
Are you... Kyou Mei?

00:12:26.980 --> 00:12:27.980
I am.

00:12:35.440 --> 00:12:39.490
Coming all this way on
your own... impressive.

00:12:39.490 --> 00:12:41.660
Where is Yuu Ren?

00:12:41.660 --> 00:12:43.700
Patience.

00:12:43.700 --> 00:12:46.490
I wish to speak with you.

00:12:46.490 --> 00:12:50.750
After all, I've not seen one
of my clan in 17 years--

00:12:50.750 --> 00:12:54.790
ever since I fled the Kyou
clan's village, that is.

00:12:54.790 --> 00:12:56.050
You fled?

00:12:56.050 --> 00:12:58.670
Didn't you hear?

00:12:58.670 --> 00:13:03.850
The Elder spoke only of an outside
group led by the supporter Kyou Mei.

00:13:03.850 --> 00:13:07.970
But our law says fleeing the
village means pursuit unto death.

00:13:09.810 --> 00:13:11.770
No, first things first:

00:13:11.770 --> 00:13:14.900
Why did you run from
the Kyou clan's village?

00:13:18.570 --> 00:13:20.700
The Ritual terrified me.

00:13:20.700 --> 00:13:21.860
The Ritual?

00:13:21.860 --> 00:13:26.910
Yes: the battle to choose
the one and only Shiyuu.

00:13:26.910 --> 00:13:30.660
I was about 15 at the time,

00:13:30.660 --> 00:13:34.500
and believed I was the strongest.

00:13:34.500 --> 00:13:35.960
But then,

00:13:35.960 --> 00:13:40.840
as all the tribes' candidates
gathered one after another,

00:13:40.840 --> 00:13:45.100
I became only too aware
of my own capabilities.

00:13:45.100 --> 00:13:49.220
That night, before I knew it, I was
desperately fleeing the village.

00:13:51.230 --> 00:13:53.850
I heard pursuers, come from the village.

00:13:59.230 --> 00:14:01.700
I killed them all.

00:14:03.360 --> 00:14:07.330
I was hardly in my right mind at the time.

00:14:07.330 --> 00:14:10.700
In the end, I made a deal.

00:14:10.700 --> 00:14:14.960
If you will work your entire life
for the Kyou clan on the outside,

00:14:14.960 --> 00:14:18.250
the clan has decided to let you be.

00:14:18.250 --> 00:14:23.550
You are dead to us in
the village now. Do not return.

00:14:23.550 --> 00:14:25.340
Do you understand,

00:14:25.340 --> 00:14:27.640
you disgrace to the Kyou clan?

00:14:32.020 --> 00:14:35.770
In truth, a scattering of
survivors outside the village

00:14:35.770 --> 00:14:39.480
prevents it from being entirely isolated.

00:14:39.480 --> 00:14:44.360
They are to send any news
back to the village.

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:47.320
With a promise that I, too,
would do this work,

00:14:47.320 --> 00:14:50.160
I was released into the wild.

00:14:50.160 --> 00:14:54.370
Now I serve as coordinator of our group.

00:14:57.540 --> 00:15:00.630
Does it make you angry,
that an escapee like me

00:15:00.630 --> 00:15:04.090
lives carefree on the outside?

00:15:04.090 --> 00:15:08.720
I'm currently in Sho,
searching for Yuu Ren's whereabouts,

00:15:08.720 --> 00:15:12.560
but I have a house in Chin.

00:15:12.560 --> 00:15:16.520
There I have a husband and two children.

00:15:16.520 --> 00:15:17.690
Eh?

00:15:17.690 --> 00:15:21.270
Isn't that awful? I abhor myself...

00:15:22.980 --> 00:15:27.240
Tch. Why am I even talking about this?

00:15:27.240 --> 00:15:30.870
Apologies. This has nothing
to do with your voyage.

00:15:33.080 --> 00:15:37.710
Shou dreamed of being
in the outside world.

00:15:37.710 --> 00:15:41.380
But she was attacked by surprise
in the Ritual and died.

00:15:41.380 --> 00:15:45.220
When I consider that...
I think you're a big cheat.

00:15:46.420 --> 00:15:48.260
Of course you do.

00:15:48.260 --> 00:15:49.260
And yet...

00:15:50.800 --> 00:15:53.890
I'm not saying I forgive you, exactly...

00:15:55.060 --> 00:16:00.060
But I think it's good to have
the option to live all-out, like you do.

00:16:04.530 --> 00:16:07.990
Though I've chosen to be
on the outside, too.

00:16:07.990 --> 00:16:10.990
Still... huh.

00:16:10.990 --> 00:16:14.040
So you have children... two of them.

00:16:14.040 --> 00:16:15.040
Wow.

00:16:16.500 --> 00:16:20.080
She differs some from what I'd been told.

00:16:20.080 --> 00:16:23.750
The village said there was nothing
to Kyou Kai but vengeance.

00:16:26.380 --> 00:16:31.340
But this girl is trying to look forward--

00:16:31.340 --> 00:16:34.720
to a path <i>beyond </i>her revenge.

00:16:34.720 --> 00:16:36.310
Kyou Kai.

00:16:36.310 --> 00:16:40.480
That is Mount Rou. Yuu Ren has
a stronghold in that mountain.

00:16:44.230 --> 00:16:47.740
It would seem Yuu Ren
is now out of control.

00:16:49.280 --> 00:16:51.160
I don't know the specifics;

00:16:51.160 --> 00:16:55.660
a personality breakdown
when she became Shiyuu.

00:16:55.660 --> 00:16:59.710
The Gi king employed her at first,
but she was let go.

00:16:59.710 --> 00:17:03.840
She drifted to Sho,
holed up in that mountain.

00:17:03.840 --> 00:17:07.420
Apparently she's connected
to the king of Sho, but...

00:17:11.130 --> 00:17:14.430
Exercise a great deal of caution.

00:17:14.430 --> 00:17:16.770
Not only does she fight dirty,

00:17:16.770 --> 00:17:20.730
but she made it through
the Ritual--unlike us.

00:17:20.730 --> 00:17:23.440
Do <i>not </i>take lightly the power
of the Shiyuu.

00:17:25.480 --> 00:17:26.690
I'll be fine.

00:17:27.820 --> 00:17:29.860
If I had been in that Ritual,

00:17:29.860 --> 00:17:32.530
that woman would <i>never</i>
have become Shiyuu!

00:17:33.820 --> 00:17:36.200
Avenge Shou for me as well.

00:17:38.790 --> 00:17:41.790
When she was born...

00:17:41.790 --> 00:17:44.380
...I was still in the village.

00:17:53.890 --> 00:17:56.510
We meet at last, Ren of the Yuu clan!

00:17:57.970 --> 00:18:01.810
You will call me "Shiyuu," little girl.

00:18:01.810 --> 00:18:04.440
I've been looking for you, you coward.

00:18:06.020 --> 00:18:07.110
Fool.

00:18:10.860 --> 00:18:15.200
I knew you were chasing after me.

00:18:15.200 --> 00:18:19.580
To think the intel I planted
actually lured you here...

00:18:19.580 --> 00:18:21.370
You scum.

00:18:21.370 --> 00:18:24.370
That old hag who'd been tracking me down

00:18:24.370 --> 00:18:28.000
should be engaging with my
underlings right about now.

00:18:49.440 --> 00:18:53.400
Don't misjudge that girl, now.

00:18:53.400 --> 00:18:59.330
She was seen as most likely to be
Shiyuu in the Ritual five years back.

00:18:59.330 --> 00:19:02.620
But a close friend's betrayal
made her miss the Ritual.

00:19:04.370 --> 00:19:10.130
Another candidate, a woman named Shou,
kept her from participating.

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:13.170
Believing she couldn't defeat this one,

00:19:13.170 --> 00:19:15.930
Shou burned incense
that put her to sleep.

00:19:15.930 --> 00:19:16.890
Wrong!

00:19:16.890 --> 00:19:20.760
Shou did that because
she didn't want to fight me!

00:19:20.760 --> 00:19:24.350
You can't know that--unless you ask her.

00:19:24.350 --> 00:19:28.900
Oh, wait: I guess she's dead, huh?

00:19:28.900 --> 00:19:30.360
Why, you...

00:19:30.360 --> 00:19:33.030
Now <i>dance</i>, Kyou Kai.

00:19:36.450 --> 00:19:40.620
My only target is Yuu Ren.
I have no quarrel with you.

00:19:40.620 --> 00:19:43.290
But get in my way and
I <i>will </i>strike you down!

00:19:48.710 --> 00:19:51.840
Save your odd concern.

00:19:51.840 --> 00:19:55.010
Soon you'll have bigger
things to worry about.

00:19:55.010 --> 00:19:57.430
Like Kyou Shou did back then.

00:19:59.090 --> 00:20:03.270
You must have seen it up close--
is that right?

00:20:05.270 --> 00:20:06.390
You know...

00:20:08.440 --> 00:20:13.020
...the agonized expression
on her severed head!

00:20:13.020 --> 00:20:14.690
Yuu Ren!

00:20:14.690 --> 00:20:15.860
Begin!

00:20:32.380 --> 00:20:36.260
This sure takes me back
to the Ritual, Seki Kaku.

00:20:41.510 --> 00:20:43.640
Don't get cocky, Kyou clan.

00:20:46.600 --> 00:21:04.910
Pum, pa-rum. Pum, pa-rum.

00:20:52.060 --> 00:20:54.770
The Yuu clan's sacred dance...

00:21:04.910 --> 00:21:07.330
Not yet, Ryo Kusui.

00:21:07.330 --> 00:21:09.580
The dance uses too much of my breath.

00:21:10.870 --> 00:21:15.090
Oh? Taking on all those
foes without a dance?

00:21:17.170 --> 00:21:21.010
You severely underestimate
the Yuu clan, little girl.

00:21:27.390 --> 00:21:29.060
She dodged it!

00:21:29.060 --> 00:21:30.390
But of course.

00:21:31.980 --> 00:21:32.980
Tch!

00:21:33.770 --> 00:21:36.980
Our sacred dance makes the
dancer's consciousness recede,

00:21:36.980 --> 00:21:39.820
but stimulates her senses.

00:21:39.820 --> 00:21:45.450
The depth of the trance is rooted in
one's skill as one of the Shiyuu tribe.

00:21:45.450 --> 00:21:48.910
Now show me, little girl--

00:21:51.000 --> 00:21:52.960
Show me your dance!

00:21:57.800 --> 00:22:01.420
That girl--she's not using her dance
out of sheer... stubbornness?

00:22:08.890 --> 00:22:10.520
Uh-oh!

00:22:10.520 --> 00:22:13.520
Honestly, I don't really <i>get</i>
the sacred dance.

00:22:16.610 --> 00:22:18.020
Here we go.

00:22:18.020 --> 00:22:20.900
Pum...

00:22:20.900 --> 00:22:23.950
What? You don't, either?

00:22:23.950 --> 00:22:29.080
Mmm. More precisely,
I get some parts, but not others.

00:22:29.080 --> 00:22:31.120
What's it like for you, Kai?

00:22:31.120 --> 00:22:33.540
Can you see your surroundings?

00:22:33.540 --> 00:22:37.000
Huh? Um... yeah, I can. More or less.

00:22:38.250 --> 00:22:43.720
But... soon everything around me
starts moving more slowly,

00:22:43.720 --> 00:22:46.430
until finally even insects
stop in mid-air.

00:22:48.470 --> 00:22:49.930
Same here.

00:22:49.930 --> 00:22:51.890
And after that--

00:22:51.890 --> 00:22:53.890
After <i>that</i>?

00:22:53.890 --> 00:22:56.190
Yeah, after that...

00:22:57.360 --> 00:22:59.900
I'm in perfectly blue water.

00:22:59.900 --> 00:23:04.200
It's so, so, clear, and blue deep inside.

00:23:04.200 --> 00:23:08.030
It goes on forever below me--
I can't see the bottom.

00:23:08.030 --> 00:23:11.490
Then I start sinking slowly down, down.

00:23:14.580 --> 00:23:16.960
Ever deeper.

00:23:16.960 --> 00:23:18.880
Pum...

00:24:52.510 --> 00:25:02.020
Another Path

00:24:54.180 --> 00:24:57.680
Next on <i>Kingdom</i>: "Another Path."
